{% comment %}
  Learn hub - the education landing page, modelled on MiaDonna's Learn page.

  A short introduction, then one card per guide: a number, a title, a sentence
  and "Learn more". The cards carry no artwork on purpose - a guide's subject is
  lettering and diagrams, and nothing legible survives at card size, which is
  why the mega menu leaves its four Learn links without pictures too.

  The guides are blocks, so the theme editor adds, reorders and relabels them.
  The preset ships the eight MiaDonna covers; their links point at pages the
  store is still to write, and a guide with no link yet reads as plain text
  rather than a dead link.

  Looks come from assets/learn-hub.css. Only the column count is written here,
  because nth-child cannot read a custom property.
{% endcomment %}

{{ 'learn-hub.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign columns = section.settings.columns | default: 2
  assign topics = section.blocks
-%}

{%- style -%}
  #learn-hub-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-block: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  /*
    The column count and the first-in-row rule both belong to the wide layout, so
    they stay inside this breakpoint: learn-hub.css keeps one column below it, and
    an id selector out here would beat that.
  */
  @media screen and (min-width: 990px) {
    #learn-hub-{{ section.id }} {
      --lh-columns: {{ columns }};
    }

    #learn-hub-{{ section.id }} .lh-card:nth-child({{ columns }}n + 1) {
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

<section
  id="learn-hub-{{ section.id }}"
  class="learn-hub color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}"
>
  <div class="lh-shell">
    <div class="lh-intro">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="lh-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}
        <h1 class="lh-heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h1>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}
        <div class="lh-description rte">{{ section.settings.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if topics.size == 0 -%}
      <p class="lh-empty">Add a guide to this section in the theme editor.</p>
    {%- else -%}
      <ul class="lh-grid" role="list">
        {%- for block in topics -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign title = block.settings.title
            if title == blank
              continue
            endif

            assign index = forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2
            assign label = block.settings.link_label | default: 'Learn more'
            assign has_link = false
            if block.settings.link != blank
              assign has_link = true
            endif
          -%}

          <li class="lh-card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if has_link -%}
              <a class="lh-card__link eden-action-host" href="{{ block.settings.link }}">
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="lh-card__link">
            {%- endif -%}

              {%- if section.settings.show_numbers -%}
                <span class="lh-card__index" aria-hidden="true">{{ index }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}

              <h2 class="lh-card__title">{{ title | escape }}</h2>

              {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
                <p class="lh-card__text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
              {%- endif -%}

              {%- if has_link -%}
                <span class="lh-card__action">
                  <span class="eden-link">{{ label | escape }}</span>
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}

            {%- if has_link -%}
              </a>
            {%- else -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Learn hub",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Education"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Lab-Grown Diamond & Gemstone Education"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "description",
      "label": "Introduction",
      "default": "<p>There is a lot to take in when you are choosing fine diamond and gemstone jewellery, from an engagement ring to a pair of everyday earrings. Explore the guides below to learn about diamonds and gemstones, caring for your jewellery, finding your ring size and more.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "columns",
      "label": "Guides across on desktop",
      "min": 1,
      "max": 4,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_numbers",
      "label": "Number the guides",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "t:settings.color_scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "label": "Top padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "label": "Bottom padding",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 160,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "topic",
      "name": "Guide",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Description"
        },
        {
          "type": "url",
          "id": "link",
          "label": "Link",
          "info": "Leave empty while the guide is still being written and the card shows as plain text."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "link_label",
          "label": "Link text",
          "default": "Learn more"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Learn hub",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The 4 C's",
            "text": "Cut, colour, clarity and carat weight are what decide a diamond's beauty and its price. Of the four, cut does the most for sparkle."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About lab-grown diamonds",
            "text": "Grown rather than mined, and identical to a mined diamond in chemistry, structure and brilliance - at roughly 40% less."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Lab-grown gemstones",
            "text": "Real sapphires, rubies and emeralds with the same properties as their mined counterparts, in colours that are hard to find in nature."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Stone comparison",
            "text": "Where a lab-grown diamond sits next to a simulant such as cubic zirconia or moissanite, and how to tell one from the other."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Find your ring size",
            "text": "A printable ring sizer, an international conversion chart, and what to do when you are buying a surprise."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Find the right metal",
            "text": "Platinum, and 14K or 18K white, yellow and rose gold - how each wears day to day and which suits which stone."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Jewellery care & cleaning",
            "text": "How to clean your pieces at home, when to have them checked, and the habits that keep a setting secure for years."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "topic",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Glossary of jewellery terms",
            "text": "Bezel, pavé, culet, girdle - the words you will meet while you shop, in plain language."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
